msgid "!!! note \"Timeout for long sequences or high concurrency\""
msgstr "!!! note \"长序列或高并发场景下的超时设置\""

msgid ""
"For long sequences or high concurrency, the default KV-cache release timeout"
" of 480 seconds may be insufficient. Increase it as needed in the prefiller "
"startup script. For versions that use `VLLM_MOONCAKE_CONNECTOR_TIMEOUT` for "
"this timeout, add:"
msgstr ""
"对于长序列或高并发场景，默认的 480 秒 KV 缓存释放超时可能不够用。请根据需要在 prefiller 启动脚本中调大该值。对于使用 "
"`VLLM_MOONCAKE_CONNECTOR_TIMEOUT` 控制该超时的版本，请添加："

msgid ""
"The value is in seconds: `1800` allows 30 minutes before timeout. In current"
" versions, this setting is named `VLLM_MOONCAKE_ABORT_REQUEST_TIMEOUT`; use "
"`export VLLM_MOONCAKE_ABORT_REQUEST_TIMEOUT=1800` instead. Check the "
"variable name supported by your installed version."
msgstr ""
"该值以秒为单位：`1800` 表示允许 30 分钟后才超时。在当前版本中，该设置名为 "
"`VLLM_MOONCAKE_ABORT_REQUEST_TIMEOUT`；请改用 `export "
"VLLM_MOONCAKE_ABORT_REQUEST_TIMEOUT=1800`。请确认你所安装版本支持的变量名。"

msgid ""
"Increasing this timeout generally does not affect inference accuracy or "
"performance during normal operation. If a decoder (D) node fails while "
"requests still have KV caches on the prefiller (P) node that the decoder has"
" not received, a longer timeout delays releasing those caches. They continue"
" to occupy HBM, reducing the memory available for other requests on the P "
"node until they are released."
msgstr ""
"调大该超时通常不会影响正常运行时的推理精度或性能。如果 decoder（D）节点发生故障，而请求仍有 KV 缓存留在 prefiller（P）节点上且 "
"decoder 尚未接收，那么更长的超时会延迟释放这些缓存。在释放之前，它们会持续占用 HBM，从而减少 P 节点上可供其他请求使用的内存。"

msgid "## MooncakeConnectorV2 (experimental)"
msgstr "## MooncakeConnectorV2（实验性）"

msgid "!!! note \"Experimental feature\""
msgstr "!!! note \"实验性功能\""

msgid ""
"MooncakeConnectorV2 is currently experimental. Its configuration and "
"supported feature combinations may change as development continues."
msgstr "MooncakeConnectorV2 目前处于实验阶段。随着开发的推进，其配置和支持的功能组合可能会发生变化。"

msgid ""
"MooncakeConnectorV2 is a refactored version of MooncakeConnectorV1, with "
"design improvements and support for more features. It uses asynchronous, "
"decoder-initiated KV-cache transfers. Its capabilities and restrictions are "
"summarized below; support for an individual feature does not imply that "
"every model and feature combination has been validated."
msgstr ""
"MooncakeConnectorV2 是 MooncakeConnectorV1 的重构版本，在设计上进行了改进并支持更多功能。它采用异步、由 "
"decoder 发起的 KV 缓存传输。其能力和限制总结如下；支持某一项功能并不意味着所有模型和功能组合都已通过验证。"

msgid "| Feature | Support and restrictions |"
msgstr "| 功能 | 支持情况与限制 |"

msgid ""
"| Parallel deployment | TP, DP, PP, PCP, and DCP, including per-rank "
"endpoint discovery and PP layer mapping. GQA CP is outside the validated "
"scope below. |"
msgstr ""
"| 并行部署 | 支持 TP、DP、PP、PCP 和 DCP，包括按 rank 的 endpoint 发现和 PP 层映射。GQA CP "
"不在下述已验证范围内。 |"

msgid ""
"| Different P/D TP sizes | Cache-layout-aware transfer for MLA, GQA, and "
"Mamba state. Supported TP ratios and head/state shapes depend on the cache "
"type; arbitrary P/D TP combinations are not supported. |"
msgstr ""
"| 不同的 P/D TP 规格 | 针对 MLA、GQA 和 Mamba 状态进行缓存布局感知的传输。支持的 TP 比例和 head/state "
"形状取决于缓存类型；不支持任意的 P/D TP 组合。 |"

msgid ""
"| KVPP | Supported for **pure MLA models only**. Do not enable KVPP and DCP "
"together on the producer. A KVPP producer can transfer to a DCP decoder. |"
msgstr ""
"| KVPP | **仅支持纯 MLA 模型**。请勿在 producer 上同时启用 KVPP 和 DCP。KVPP producer 可以传输到 "
"DCP decoder。 |"

msgid ""
"| Hybrid cache groups | Attention KV caches and Mamba convolution/recurrent "
"states, including hybrid model cache-group mapping. |"
msgstr "| 混合缓存组 | 支持 Attention KV 缓存和 Mamba 卷积/循环状态，包括混合模型缓存组映射。 |"

msgid ""
"| GQA | **Experimental; only the `LBHNC` and `HND` KV-cache layouts are "
"supported.** Validated with Qwen3 pure GQA models and Qwen3.5 GQA + Mamba "
"hybrid models. **GQA CP (PCP/DCP) and GQA C8 (INT8 KV cache) are not "
"included in this validation.** |"
msgstr ""
"| GQA | **实验性；仅支持 `LBHNC` 和 `HND` KV 缓存布局。** 已使用 Qwen3 纯 GQA 模型和 Qwen3.5 GQA"
" + Mamba 混合模型进行验证。**本次验证不包含 GQA CP（PCP/DCP）和 GQA C8（INT8 KV 缓存）。** |"

msgid ""
"| P/D block sizes and scales | Full-attention/MLA paths can map different "
"logical block sizes/scales when the underlying kernel block size and "
"physical transfer layout are compatible. SWA requires equal P/D logical "
"block sizes. |"
msgstr ""
"| P/D block 大小和 scale | 当底层 kernel block 大小和物理传输布局兼容时，full-attention/MLA "
"路径可以映射不同的逻辑 block 大小/scale。SWA 要求 P/D 逻辑 block 大小相等。 |"

msgid ""
"| Prefix-cache reuse | Accounts for local prefix-cache hits when determining"
" the KV blocks to receive, including hybrid cache groups. |"
msgstr ""
"| Prefix-cache 复用 | 在确定要接收的 KV block 时会考虑本地 prefix-cache 命中情况，包括混合缓存组。 |"

msgid ""
"| Model Runner V2 cache layouts | Includes compressed attention/indexer and "
"hybrid state handling used by GLM-5.3-Flash. This does not imply support for"
" every model-specific cache specification. |"
msgstr ""
"| Model Runner V2 缓存布局 | 包括 GLM-5.3-Flash 使用的压缩 attention/indexer "
"和混合状态处理。这并不意味着支持所有模型特定的缓存规范。 |"

msgid ""
"| Receive failure handling | Reports failed KV loads to the scheduler for "
"the configured `kv_load_failure_policy`, and notifies the producer to "
"release retained blocks. |"
msgstr ""
"| 接收失败处理 | 按照配置的 `kv_load_failure_policy` 将失败的 KV 加载上报给 scheduler，并通知 "
"producer 释放保留的 block。 |"

msgid ""
"| Completion and cleanup | Decoder completion notifications release producer"
" blocks; timeout cleanup handles requests whose completion notification is "
"missing. |"
msgstr "| 完成与清理 | Decoder 完成通知会释放 producer block；超时清理会处理缺少完成通知的请求。 |"

msgid ""
"| Transfer metrics | Transfer duration, transferred bytes, and failed-"
"transfer metrics. |"
msgstr "| 传输指标 | 传输耗时、传输字节数和传输失败指标。 |"

msgid "### Layout and port configuration"
msgstr "### 布局与端口配置"

msgid ""
"GQA is supported only with the `LBHNC` or `HND` KV-cache layout. Set "
"`VLLM_KV_CACHE_LAYOUT=LBHNC` or `VLLM_KV_CACHE_LAYOUT=HND` in **both** P and"
" D startup scripts, using the same value on both sides. Select "
"`MooncakeConnectorV2`, with `kv_producer` on P and `kv_consumer` on D. Use "
"compatible vLLM/vLLM-Ascend versions and the same model weights on both "
"sides."
msgstr ""
"GQA 仅在 `LBHNC` 或 `HND` KV 缓存布局下受支持。请在 P 和 D 的**两个**启动脚本中都设置 "
"`VLLM_KV_CACHE_LAYOUT=LBHNC` 或 `VLLM_KV_CACHE_LAYOUT=HND`，且两侧使用相同的值。选择 "
"`MooncakeConnectorV2`，在 P 上使用 `kv_producer`，在 D 上使用 `kv_consumer`。两侧请使用兼容的 "
"vLLM/vLLM-Ascend 版本以及相同的模型权重。"

msgid ""
"If `kv_port` is omitted from `--kv-transfer-config`, MooncakeConnectorV2 "
"derives its endpoints from vLLM's default `kv_port` (currently `14579`). It "
"does not derive the KV endpoints from the HTTP `--port`."
msgstr ""
"如果 `--kv-transfer-config` 中省略了 `kv_port`，MooncakeConnectorV2 会从 vLLM 的默认 "
"`kv_port`（当前为 `14579`）推导其 endpoint。它不会从 HTTP `--port` 推导 KV endpoint。"

msgid ""
"- **Single-host PD or multiple instances on one host:** explicitly configure a different `kv_port` for each instance, and reserve non-overlapping port ranges. Different HTTP ports alone are insufficient.\n"
"- **Multiple hosts with one instance per host:** `kv_port` can be omitted. Each host can use the same default port, provided the required ports are free and reachable.\n"
"- Each instance reserves worker handshake ports starting at `kv_port`, followed by scheduler control ports. Reserve `DP * PP * PCP * TP + DP` consecutive ports per instance. For the TP=DP=PP=PCP=1 examples below, this is two ports per instance. Increase the spacing when scaling parallelism, and keep these ranges separate from API, proxy, and distributed communication ports."
msgstr ""
"- **单机 PD 或单机多实例：** 请为每个实例显式配置不同的 `kv_port`，并预留互不重叠的端口范围。仅使用不同的 HTTP 端口是不够的。\n"
"- **多机且每机一个实例：** 可以省略 `kv_port`。只要所需端口空闲且可达，每台主机都可以使用相同的默认端口。\n"
"- 每个实例会从 `kv_port` 开始预留 worker 握手端口，随后是 scheduler 控制端口。请为每个实例预留 `DP * PP * PCP * TP + DP` 个连续端口。对于下面 TP=DP=PP=PCP=1 的示例，即每个实例两个端口。在扩展并行度时请增大端口间隔，并将这些范围与 API、代理和分布式通信端口分开。"

msgid "### Complete GQA startup example"
msgstr "### 完整的 GQA 启动示例"

msgid ""
"Complete the environment and Mooncake installation steps earlier in this "
"guide first. Run the scripts from the vllm-ascend repository root in "
"separate terminals. Replace the model path, host IPs, network interface, and"
" NPU IDs with your deployment values. These examples use Qwen3-8B with one "
"NPU per role; for Qwen3.5, replace the model path on both sides with the "
"same GQA + Mamba model and choose enough NPUs and matching TP settings for "
"that model."
msgstr ""
"请先完成本指南前面的环境和 Mooncake 安装步骤。在单独的终端中从 vllm-ascend 仓库根目录运行脚本。请将模型路径、主机 "
"IP、网络接口和 NPU ID 替换为你的部署值。这些示例使用 Qwen3-8B，每个角色一个 NPU；对于 "
"Qwen3.5，请将两侧的模型路径替换为相同的 GQA + Mamba 模型，并为该模型选择足够数量的 NPU 和匹配的 TP 设置。"

msgid ""
"The examples keep CP, KVPP, and KV-cache quantization disabled. To try "
"`HND`, replace `LBHNC` with `HND` in both startup scripts."
msgstr ""
"这些示例保持 CP、KVPP 和 KV 缓存量化处于禁用状态。如需尝试 `HND`，请在两个启动脚本中将 `LBHNC` 替换为 `HND`。"

msgid ""
"This example deploys P and D on `192.168.0.1`, using NPU 0 and NPU 1. P "
"reserves KV ports `30000`–`30001`; D reserves `30100`–`30101`. Their API "
"ports are `8100` and `8200`."
msgstr ""
"本示例在 `192.168.0.1` 上部署 P 和 D，使用 NPU 0 和 NPU 1。P 预留 KV 端口 `30000`–`30001`；D "
"预留 `30100`–`30101`。它们的 API 端口分别为 `8100` 和 `8200`。"

